libdrm (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/drm) has no licence file of its own: each source file carries an MIT
licence with its own copyright lines. ffmpeg-build keeps this copy beside the recipe so the archives carry it. The
notices of the core library (libdrm.so's xf86drm*.c), which FFmpeg's DRM and VAAPI code links:

